# Keep the toolchain pin out of the builder image. The Dockerfile deliberately
# builds on `rust:1.89-slim` to prove the crate still compiles at its declared
# MSRV, and those images ship rustup on PATH — so a copied rust-toolchain.toml
# would make cargo download the pinned toolchain instead, silently retiring the
# MSRV check and rebuilding the shipped binary with a different compiler.
rust-toolchain.toml
